agent-panel speaks the Agent Client Protocol through @agentclientprotocol/sdk
(Apache-2.0, https://agentclientprotocol.com).

The embeddable panel idea follows open-slide (MIT, copyright 2026 Yiwei Ho,
https://github.com/open-slide/open-slide). This tree does not copy open-slide's
provider runners or session store. Agent backends are ACP agents. Detection and
launch of many local agents is covered by @tutti-os/agent-acp-kit. A full ACP
workbench UI is covered by acp-components (https://github.com/Endlessworld/acp-components).
